  {
    "id": "action.upload",
    "category": "action",
    "label": "Upload to Bucket",
    "description": "Uploads a file, or the contents of a folder, to a saved bucket destination, under the key prefix. Objects already in the bucket at the same size are skipped, so a run that stopped carries on where it left off. The source is a path inside the server's folder, or its backups.",
